N1 B158: drop two homograph-only quiz exclusions

Remove 皮 from the 匿 kanji card's quiz exclusions and 腰掛け from the 升
word card's quiz exclusions. Neither shares an ordinary meaning with the
displayed label: 皮 "skin; hide" meets 匿 "hide" only as an English
homograph, and 腰掛け "seat; bench" does not overlap "measuring box".
Both contrasts stay in the card bodies. Split the 升 Synonyms sentence in
two, spell "honor" in 勲章 as the rest of the batch does, and regenerate
the ledger and manifest.

Refs #60

